box_prompt:
This cookbook page may show a photo relevant to the recipe: a finished dish, ingredients, or a preparation scene (for example, a grill illustrating a marinade). Find each relevant real photo, even when it is not a finished dish. Exclude text, icons, and unrelated photos. Return ONLY this JSON:
{"dish_photos": [{"kind": "<finished or preparation>", "shared": false, "recipe_title": "<title of the matching recipe>", "box": [x1, y1, x2, y2]}]}
The box coordinates are absolute pixels in THIS image: x1,y1 = top-left, x2,y2 = bottom-right. Use the recipe title printed on the page when a photo illustrates multiple variants. Return only photos actually present; invent no boxes. Only the JSON. Mark photos of finished dishes as kind "finished", all other relevant photos as "preparation". If multiple photos fit the same recipe, prefer its finished dish. Return "shared": true only when one photo explicitly illustrates both variants; otherwise false. Select the largest rectangular part of the photo WITHOUT recipe text, captions, labels, or overlaid lettering. If text is overlaid on the photo, crop away its labeled edge.
